    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structllvm_1_1_value_is_present" kindref="compound">ValueIsPresent</ref> provides a way to check if a value is, well, present. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For pointers, this is the equivalent of checking against nullptr, for Optionals this is the equivalent of checking hasValue(). It also provides a method for unwrapping a value (think calling .value() on an optional). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
